<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-045" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-045-lastprinces-min" source-id="s-nanqishu-045-lastprinces-min-ws2273185">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-045-lastprinces-min:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">明帝卽位，以永陽王<persName id="c-nanqishu-045-lastprinces-min:p001:m0009" ref="kix_r92_2ed_N">子珉</persName>仍本國，繼元王爲孫。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-045-lastprinces-min:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-045-lastprinces-min:p002:m0000" ref="kix_r92_2ed_N">子珉</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-045-lastprinces-min:p002:m0003" ref="kix_r92_2ed_N">雲璵</persName>，世祖第二十子也。永明七年，封義安王，後改永陽。永泰元年見害，年十四。</p>
</text>
